      "text": "# LIVED — The Name — flow\n\n**Card** LIVED\n**Day** 2\n\nChapter note: [[03 LIVED — The Name]]\n\n---\n\nWorking surface, not canon. Fill from the chapter note, never the other way round. 🔧 marks nothing settled.\n\nStructure: [[The Day Loop]] · [[Saving]]\nLocks: [[Scope Ledger]]"
