      "id": "puzzles",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 242,
      "text": "## Puzzles\n\n- **Coffee** — the delivery port taught warm and unthreatening. See [[The Cafeteria]].\n- **The corridor to [[Room 232]]** — teaches both light verbs: the flash disperses, film seals permanently.\n- **The Accumulation** — the demo-adjacent monster spawn and the two-verb showcase.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "mazepocket",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 512,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## Maze / pocket\n\n- [[The Sleep Maze]]. In through [[Room 232]], out through the smoke-locked door.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cutscenes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 216,
      "text": "## Cutscenes\n\n- Opens on a reflection in a coffee mug in [[The Cafeteria]].\n- The mirror holds his reflection one beat too long.\n- Title card in a water reflection, DEVIL semi-visible.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "npcdialogue",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 276,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## NPC dialogue\n\n- **[[Noel]]**, first meeting, on the cafeteria shift. Opening line is Otto's: \"So... you're saying that you and Leon are twins.\"\n- Noel introduces [[Elle]], [[Nan]] and [[Eve]] in her [[Room 101]] form. [[Pip]] does not appear."
    },
